<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | Clinic Appointment System</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111; }
        .navbar { padding: 20px 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; background-color: #fff; }
        .navbar-brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.6rem; color: #000 !important; }
        .nav-link { color: #000; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; }
        .nav-link:hover { color: #555; }
        .nav-icons i { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #000; cursor: pointer; }
        
        .page-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 80px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        .section-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 3rem; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .luxury-text { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #444; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero-img { border-radius: 30px; width: 100%; height: 500px; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .stat-box { border-left: 3px solid #D6CCC2; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .stat-number { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #666; }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/clinic-theme.css">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION BAR -->
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <!-- ABOUT US CONTENT -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h1 class="section-title">Redefining Healthcare Excellence.</h1>
                <p class="luxury-text">Established to serve those who demand the absolute best, our private clinic merges world-class medical expertise with the comfort and discretion of a five-star sanctuary.</p>
                <p class="luxury-text">We believe your health is your most vital asset. Our bespoke care models are designed entirely around your schedule, your privacy, and your exact physiological needs.</p>
                
                <div class="d-flex gap-5 mt-5">
                    <div class="stat-box">
                        <p class="stat-number">15+</p>
                        <p class="stat-label">Global Specialists</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-box">
                        <p class="stat-number">24/7</p>
                        <p class="stat-label">Concierge Access</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579684385127-1ef15d508118?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" class="hero-img" alt="Luxury Clinic Interior">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>